            "review_text": "maryyeo\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam4531 contributions\n0\n5* for its whimsical country setting & colours everywhere!\nApr 2015 • Couples\nYou won't feel like you're in Vietnam. The colours come splashing at you that you won't know where to set your eyes on. Such a great place to capture photos, no wonder we saw many couples doing their bridal shoots there. Love how they terraced each level and have sort of a different kind of country theme within every room/level. Such a great place to explore, run around, up and down the stairs, the rooftop, the balconies, and just imagine you're in some fantasy country place!!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 15, 2016",
